    imageAlt: 'Sponge filter foam, home of the nitrifying bacteria that power the nitrogen cycle',
    imageCredit: 'Ofkun, CC BY-SA 4.0 via Wikimedia Commons',
    excerpt: 'The nitrogen cycle is why your fish survive. Learn how ammonia becomes nitrate, why your filter is a bacteria farm, and how to cycle a tank safely.',
